SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance LIVE MUSIC w/ Trey Crispen and Nata Das
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, August 9th\n\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nLIVE MUSI
 C w/ Trey Crispen and Nata Das/\nSupport Facilitator Jeannie Adair\n\nInte
 ntion: Open Spaces\n\nFind the uncrowded and open internal spaces and brin
 g that expansiveness to the dance floor. Let the crowded and bustling part
 s of you sit still while the vast open landscape of your awareness expands
  as you dance it out.\nWe will travel this space together.\n\nAbout the Mu
 sicians:\nNata Das is a local Asheville group that has been playing for th
 e AMC for 12 years. We will be using the movements of the dancers present 
 to help shape the ebb and flow of this dance. Together we will make a very
  interdependent experience that can be very satisfying for all of us.\n\nN
 ata Das for this dance is:\nTrey Crispin and Friends\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\
 * Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly a
 t Opening Circle and people who arrive late will be turned away. Please be
  on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $2
 5-50 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\
 \~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nFirst Wave: [https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/uqbb](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/uqbb)\nSecon
 d Wave: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/6r3x](https://ashevillemo
 vementcollective.org/6r3x)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer an
 d dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcoll
 ective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?
 fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyM
 jAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWu
 iBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will
  close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER
  OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillem
 ovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYX
 BwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T
 6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Mo
 vement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are fr
 ee to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and
  aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form d
 ance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC
  is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
