SUMMARY:Like the First Time - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, August 16th\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitato
 r Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: Like the First Time\n\nImagine yourself exper
 iencing music for the very first time. Your body naturally reacts to the r
 hythms\, spontaneously engaged with beat and melody. Before the concepts o
 f dance\, grace\, or acceptable moves exist in your mind\, before the impr
 ints of cultural norms take root in your cells\, your body simply played i
 n the field of music.\n\nThis is an invitation to release all you think an
 d feel and know about dancing and come explore the floor with the innocenc
 e of a toddler. Allow yourself to take a break from patterns of movement y
 ou've cultivated throughout your life\, to experiment with new ways of res
 ponding to music and community and to re-set your nervous system with your
  organic expressions.\n\n## About Sara Bensman\n\nSara’s mix-making aris
 es from musical exploration. She seeks to understand energy through somati
 c responses to sonic vibrations. Her facilitation is propelled by a desire
  to help build and sustain community by creating a safe\, loving container
  for self-expression\, connection and release. If you’d like to listen t
 o her sets visit [https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman](https://soundcloud.
 com/sara-bensman)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts a
 t Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come la
 te will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure cont
 ainer. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turn
 ed away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\
 nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer a
 t:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://asheville
 movementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0Z
 zTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8
 I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nI
 MPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening
  circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollect
 ive agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYn
 JpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFI
 NP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootR
 UE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world th
 at moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within
  a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and h
 ealthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for person
 al and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization
 .\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance f
 loor!
