SUMMARY:Lost - Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, August 23rd\n1st Dance
  Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance W
 ave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitato
 r Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: Lost\n\nStand still. The trees ahead and bushes
  beside you\nAre not lost. Wherever you are is called Here\,\nAnd you must
  treat it as a powerful stranger\,\nMust ask permission to know it and be 
 known.\nThe forest breathes. Listen. It answers\,\nI have made this place 
 around you.\nIf you leave it\, you may come back again\, saying Here.\nNo 
 two trees are the same to Raven.\nNo two branches are the same to Wren.\nI
 f what a tree or a bush does is lost on you\,\nYou are surely lost. Stand 
 still. The forest knows\nWhere you are. You must let it find you.\n*\\-\\-
 \\- David Wagoner*\n\nI can never be lost\, and I can never be abandoned\,
  because wherever I go\, there I am.\n\n## About Ted Riskin\n\nTed is inte
 rested in anything that can get him out of his head\, and music and moveme
 nt do a pretty good job of that. He hopes to offer music that facilitates 
 an inner journey and invitations that create a shift. While he likes moder
 n electronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lots of nat
 ural instruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in l
 ots of different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [https:
 //www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\n\\~\\~\\~
 \n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close p
 romptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Plea
 se be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices
 : $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n
 Pre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunte
 er and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemoveme
 ntcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volun
 teer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2l
 kEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3
 ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nD
 oor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENT
 RY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://as
 hevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollect
 ive.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RX
 NydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LM
 LwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAshe
 ville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where al
 l are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mis
 sion and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through fre
 e-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformat
 ion. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, 
 Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
