SUMMARY: Expansion - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Marta Martin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, August 28th\nEvening D
 ance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFa
 cilitator Jeannie Adair\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Facilitator Jeannie 
 Adair\n\nJeannie is a mixed media artist\, experience designer & movement 
 medicine evangelist. She curates soulful journeys that invite emotional re
 lease & authentic connection. An AMC facilitator since 2023\, she’s here
  to hold space with intention\, care\, and a loving heart. Find her ecstat
 ic dance mixes on Soundcloud at [https://soundcloud.com/dancingleontine](h
 ttps://soundcloud.com/dancingleontine) and her artwork on Instagram: [http
 s://www.instagram.com/leontine.creative/](https://www.instagram.com/leonti
 ne.creative/)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at 
 Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late
  will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure contai
 ner. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned
  away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nW
